# eve script.eve -h prints the help made from the ** @param comments and the parameters of process main; the script does not run
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#parameters-on-the-command-line
** @param n:Integer; how many rows
** @param label:String; the name of the report
primary aspect a99_script_help is
  process main(n :Integer, label = "report" :String) is
    print "never";
  return;
end a99_script_help;
